{
  "name": "Ringee: Make your first AI phone call from n8n",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Make your first AI phone call\nThis places **one real call**: an AI voice agent phones the number below, then you read what happened.\n\n1. Connect your **Ringee API** credential on both Ringee nodes.\n2. In *Start AI call*, pick your agent and replace the phone number with **your own test number**.\n3. Click **Execute workflow**.\n\nStart Call returns an operation that may be queued or already starting. The second node waits two minutes and reads the result. In real workflows, react to the call ending with a **Ringee Trigger** instead of waiting (see the other templates).\n\n[Ringee](https://ringee.io) · [Docs](https://docs.ringee.io)\n\nEvery click starts a new call. If n8n retries one click, the node still makes sure it is dialed once.",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "97fd8bec-6846-5894-885e-c2bad876d65f",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Consent and calling hours**\nOnly call people who agreed to be called, and only at reasonable hours. Ringee blocks numbers on your Do-Not-Call list and respects your plan's limits, but you are responsible for the permission to call. Every phone number in this template is fictional.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "b67da179-749d-5794-8e95-84d95246ab4a",
      "name": "Consent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
